.TH DICTATE-STATUS 1 "" "dictate" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dictate-status \- the dictation state as a tmux status segment
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dictate-status
.SH DESCRIPTION
Prints the phase of
.BR dictate (1)
in tmux colours, or nothing when idle.
.PP
.I /usr/share/dictate/dictate.tmux
puts it where
.B #{dictate_status}
is written in
.B status-left
or
.BR status-right ;
TPM runs the same file from the repository. The counter ticks at
.BR status-interval .
.SH OPTIONS
tmux options, read only while there is something to draw:
.TP
.B @dictate-rec-style
style while recording; default
.BR fg=#ffffff,bg=#ff3b30,bold .
.TP
.B @dictate-busy-style
style while transcribing; default
.BR fg=#1c1c1e,bg=#ff9500,bold .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dictate (1)
